STEP 5  |  Final hypothesis
========================================================================================
HYPOTHESIS: In a logistic regression of BA DEGREE COMPLETED on race with an SES interaction and White as the reference category, the coefficient (log-odds) for Black respondents vs White respondents is -0.9568 (OR=0.384, p<0.001). Therefore the -0.9568 factor of BA degree completion applies between the two races BLACK and WHITE (Black relative to White), i.e. Black respondents have a significantly lower log-odds of completing a BA degree than White respondents at SES=0 in this model.
